---
title: "transfer (Sui Framework: token)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_amount: amount = t.balance.value()
    q_get_amount --> q_transfer: transfer::transfer(t, recipient)
    q_transfer --> q_create_request: new_request(transfer_action, amount, some(recipient), none)
    q_create_request --> [*]: return ActionRequest

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: token is transferred before ActionRequest is created
        INV-002: ActionRequest must be confirmed by TokenPolicy or cap
        INV-003: recipient is recorded in ActionRequest for rule verification
    end note
